{"qid": "NQ-M9", "group": "新语料·月报", "question": "第一章载明本月抽油机时率 95.0% 及其损失构成。请：①逐项列出五项时率损失各占的百分点数；②第一章构成中的\"计划性检泵 0.6 个百分点\"与第二章说明三里哪两口井直接对应？这两口井的作业在\"当月躺井井次\"与\"检泵作业井次\"两个统计中各计不计入？③辨析：第一章中\"0.6 个百分点\"一共在两处出现（环比提高 0.6 个百分点／计划性检泵占 0.6 个百分点），两者含义是否相同？", "frozen_date": "2026-10-08", "ask_started_at": "2026-10-17T03:20:41.416235", "ask_ended_at": "2026-10-17T03:21:00.906915", "run_id": "run-87b96581", "chain": null, "answer_head": "一个是总量环比差，一个是损失构成占比，量纲相同（个百分点）但所指对象与意义不同，不可混同。", "citations": 53, "duration_s": 19.5, "frame_file": "EB2-NQ-M9.json", "error": null, "steps": "decision→decision→decision→decision→decision→decision→decision→execute→execute→execute→answer→answer→verify→answer", "spend": {"calls": 4, "fallback_calls": 0, "input_tokens": 40708, "output_tokens": 1217, "cost_yuan": 0.044359, "by_caller": {"understand": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 2923, "output_tokens": 128, "cost_yuan": 0.003307}, "decision": {"calls": 2, "input_tokens": 19354, "output_tokens": 544, "cost_yuan": 0.020986}, "answer": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 18431, "output_tokens": 545, "cost_yuan": 0.020066}}, "call_ids": ["call-aa16c6c0", "call-c2517037", "call-feb10821", "call-4f6dcdce"], "ledger_run_ids": ["run-87b96581", "run-87b96581", "run-87b96581", "run-87b96581"], "method": "run_id"}}
